{"id":"4e82bf98ddd67bdd","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing.md","title":"von Neumann偏币去偏","display":"lem-von-neumann-unbiasing — von Neumann偏币去偏","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing","aliases":["28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing"],"display":"lem-von-neumann-unbiasing — von Neumann偏币去偏","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Lemma 7.13 and proof","source_printed_pages":"135","source_pdf_pages":"161","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-von-neumann-unbiasing — von Neumann偏币去偏"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Lemma 7.13 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"135"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"161"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\rho&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;\\rho&lt;1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X_i)_{i\\ge1}\">\\((X_i)_{i\\ge1}\\)</span> 是独立同分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 值随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[X_i=1]=\\rho\">\\(\\Pr[X_i=1]=\\rho\\)</span>。期望取扩展非负实数值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\varnothing=\\infty\">\\(\\min\\varnothing=\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\ge1:X_{2j-1}\\ne X_{2j}\\},\\qquad Y\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}X_{2J-1}&amp;J&lt;\\infty,\\\\0&amp;J=\\infty.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\ge1:X_{2j-1}\\ne X_{2j}\\},\\qquad Y\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}X_{2J-1}&amp;J&lt;\\infty,\\\\0&amp;J=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[J&lt;\\infty]=1,\\qquad\\Pr[Y=1]=\\Pr[Y=0]=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\\mathbb E[2J]=\\frac1{\\rho(1-\\rho)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[J&lt;\\infty]=1,\\qquad\\Pr[Y=1]=\\Pr[Y=0]=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\\mathbb E[2J]=\\frac1{\\rho(1-\\rho)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每对出现10和01的概率均为ρ(1−ρ)，停止概率为2ρ(1−ρ)&gt;0，因此J为该参数的几何变量。条件于停止发生在任意一对，两个输出等概率；期望掷币数2EJ即所列值。算法不需要预先知道ρ，但必须依赖硬币之间的独立性。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 7.13 and proof；印刷 pp.135 / PDF pp.161。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"0<\\rho<1","display":false},{"tex":"(X_i)_{i\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[X_i=1]=\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\varnothing=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"J\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\ge1:X_{2j-1}\\ne X_{2j}\\},\\qquad Y\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}X_{2J-1}&J<\\infty,\\\\0&J=\\infty.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr[J<\\infty]=1,\\qquad\\Pr[Y=1]=\\Pr[Y=0]=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\\mathbb E[2J]=\\frac1{\\rho(1-\\rho)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1516,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-bptime]]、[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]、[[28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure]]、[[28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing]]、[[28-lem-computable-biased-coin]]、[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]、[[28-df-bpl-rl]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}